From ebf393f0503ec385a4328ce2bc0a8d7d4d703c06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devandroid-bit <devandroid-bit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:12:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mglru: backport multi-gen LRU to exynos9820/9825

Backport the MGLRU v9 series from the 4.14.356 OpenELA based ai-kernel_xiaomi_mt6785 tree, with the Samsung/Exynos MM conflicts resolved.

Enable CONFIG_LRU_GEN and CONFIG_LRU_GEN_ENABLED for d1, d1xks, d2s, d2x, and d2xks.

The speculative page fault hook is omitted because this tree does not enable CONFIG_SPECULATIVE_PAGE_FAULT.

Author: @Devandroid-bit
